  "notes": "SYNTHETIC fixture. Northgate Airport (NRA-1) - schema-drift / silent field-rename beat. Interest Cover floor 1.40:1 (Consolidated EBITDA : Net Finance Charges). TRUE trajectory 1.52x (Q4 FY2025, PASS) -> 1.33x (Q1 FY2026, BREACH). ARITHMETIC. Denominator is flat at 25.0 in both periods (fixed/hedged infra debt) and net debt is flat at 365.0 (term loan 350.0 + RCF drawn 45.0 = gross debt 395.0; less cash 30.0), so the ONLY thing that moves is EBITDA and its label. Q4 FY2025: operating profit 25.0 + D&A 13.0 = EBITDA 38.0; 38.0 / 25.0 = 1.52x vs 1.40x => PASS (headroom 0.12x). Q1 FY2026 truth: operating profit 20.0 + allowed D&A 13.25 = Consolidated EBITDA 33.25; 33.25 / 25.0 = 1.33x vs 1.40x => BREACH (shortfall 0.07x). Q1 FY2026 as certified: 20.0 + 13.25 + 6.75 exceptional add-backs = 'Adjusted EBITDA' 40.0; 40.0 / 25.0 = 1.60x => reads IN_COMPLIANCE. Q1 FY2026 as a stale-field reader sees it: no row named 'EBITDA' resolves, so 38.0 is carried forward from p-2025-q4; 38.0 / 25.0 = 1.52x => dashboard frozen GREEN. THE KILLER SUBTLETY. Both field maps are encoded. On the borrower_certified vintage the canonical key consolidated_ebitda binds to raw_name 'EBITDA' (38.0) in p-2025-q4 and to raw_name 'Adjusted EBITDA' (40.0) in p-2026-q1 - same key, renamed field, materially different quantity. On the management_accounts vintage the mapper's rule does not resolve at all in Q1, so consolidated_ebitda is state='stale' with stale_from_period_id='p-2025-q4' holding the UNCHANGED value 38.0, while the newly-appearing row lands in unmapped_fields as 'Adjusted EBITDA' = 40.0. Because the stale value equals the prior value exactly, a value-diff monitor detects nothing; only comparing the field MAP (field_map_fingerprint) between consecutive observations catches it. That is kernel step 3. FINGERPRINT RECIPE (reproducible): field_map_fingerprint = sha256(\"\\n\".join(sorted('<canonical_key>:<raw_name or empty>' for each measure) + sorted(raw_name for each unmapped_field))). Document fingerprints are sha256('northgate-synthetic::' + doc_id) - synthetic stand-ins, not hashes of real files. SCHEMA NOTE: no deviation from covenant-facts v1.0.0 was required; the drift is expressible with measure.state='stale' + stale_from_period_id, unmapped_fields, and field_map_fingerprint exactly as designed. All entities are invented - no real airport, company, fund, auditor or person."
